  "Name": "Insurance",
  "Description": "## Insurance\n\nThe Insurance domain manages customer insurance coverage and the financial lifecycle of policies. It includes insurance plans with tiers, premiums, deductibles, out-of-pocket limits, and coinsurance rates. Customers can hold policies managed by insurance agents, make premium payments, and submit claims linked to healthcare visits.\n\nKey areas include:\n\n- Insurance plans and coverage terms\n- Customer policies and policy status\n- Policy start and end dates\n- Premium payments\n- Healthcare claims\n- Billed, allowed, and paid amounts\n- Claim processing status and denial reasons",
